# Control Panel Segments / Features ticks — LOCKED

Do **not** change the design of Segments or Features tickable rows unless Ikram (the user) **personally and explicitly** asks to change that design.

## Locked setup (keep as-is)

- Square checkbox with the tick **inside** the box
- **Bright** checkbox interior in both themes (Dark: `#f0fdfa`; Ocean: `#ffffff`) — must use `!important` so App.css / midnight input overrides cannot darken them
- Dark checked fill `#2dd4bf` with dark tick; Ocean checked fill `#0284c7` with white tick
- **On / Off** is status text only (`master-check-state`): not a button, `pointer-events: none`, shows On when ticked and Off when not
- Whole row remains the click target via the `<label className="master-check">`

## Files

- `src/screens/control/ControlPanel.css` — `.master-check*` rules
- `src/screens/control/ControlHomeScreen.tsx` — Segments / Features markup

## Allowed without redesign request

- Bug fixes that preserve this look (e.g. override regressions, accessibility)
- Unrelated Control Panel work (lists, delete zone, limits, theme switcher chrome)

## Not allowed without explicit user request

- Circles, switches, pill On/Off buttons, new colors, layout of these tabs/tiles, or “refreshing” this UI
